{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\n\t\t\t海關在機場偵破一宗販毒案件，檢獲約7.3公斤懷疑大麻花，估計市值約160萬元，拘捕一名23歲內地男子。<br/>\n<br/>\n該名男子從泰國曼谷抵港，海關人員在他的隨身行李檢獲該批懷疑大麻花，於是將他拘捕，並控以一項販運危險藥物罪。案件將於明日在西九龍裁判法院提堂。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n編輯：陳樂謙\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-26T12:03:53.498670+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":129,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-26T11:44:51+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-27T02:57:35.430486+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-26T11:57:24.452291+00:00","content_hash":"3d36be873ea2bd4f6549071fe85180f503f69116640a4d0e73f96a8a515af3d2","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}